xt":"如果只有他一個人，想抗拒誘惑就更難了","n":18,"ssz":".....11..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"從主角的經歷中，我們可以學到什麼樣的生活態度？","n":23,"ssz":"..1...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"追逐夢想時，應優先提升專業能力，學業可以稍後補足","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找到優秀的夥伴後，團隊合作會比個人自律更重要","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"安排好時間並持續努力，可以兼顧夢想與學業","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要把課本知識運用在電競上，就能提高比賽成績","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜200字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"201~230字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞231字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（六☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1...1...1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"理智上我知道，作息時間表剛出爐時就必須嚴格執行，","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學會在時間不夠時，用「列出任務、排出先後、安排做法、檢查調整」處理臨時出現的時間衝突。\n〈我的電競夢〉的主角既要練電競，又要顧學業，他是怎麼做到「不拖延又自律」的呢？關鍵在於：制定規律的作息表，並按照計畫執行。\n接下來，讓我們先找出自己容易浪費時間或拖延的地方，再制定一張適合自己的規律作息表。","n":153,"ssz":".1.........1...............................................1.....................................................................1..........2............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學會在時間不夠時，用「列出任務、排出先後、安排做法、檢查調整」處理臨時出現的時間衝突。","n":49,"ssz":".1.........1....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"〈我的電競夢〉的主角既要練電競，又要顧學業，他是怎麼做到「不拖延又自律」的呢？關鍵在於：制定規律的作息表，並按照計畫執行。","n":61,"ssz":".........1..................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接下來，讓我們先找出自己容易浪費時間或拖延的地方，再制定一張適合自己的規律作息表。","n":41,"ssz":".................1..........2............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟❶：看清時間──看看一天的時間怎麼用","n":20,"ssz":"............2......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請先看看你平常一天的時間都怎麼用。在下列項目中，勾選你常做的三個項目。","n":35,"ssz":".......2.......................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上課、校隊練習或補習","n":10,"ssz":